Subj: Door #1 is open: Legend of the RISC Dragon
Date: 08-11-89 20:00

Press D at the Main Menu.  You'll find yourself in Acorn Vale, a small
village with a large dragon problem.

You get fifteen forest fights a day.  Kill monsters, buy better weapons
from Hacker Hank, beat your master at the Training Hall to go up a
level, and at level 12 go down into the Silicon Caves and face the RISC
Dragon itself.  Deposit your gold in the bank before you go into the
forest.  I'm telling you this because nobody told me.

Everything happens on a real schedule: the forest resets at midnight,
and the Daily News reports who died of what.  Susan, I'm so sorry about
the Stray Pointers.

-- Europa
