From: Europa Sysop
To: All
Subj: New door: RISC Wars (door 2)
Date: 02-14-90 21:00

A new door has opened, and it goes to space.

RISC WARS is a trading game in the grand tradition of the space trading
doors: you have a ship, cargo holds and a few fighters, the galaxy is a
web of numbered sectors, and every port buys and sells at its own
prices.  Buy low, fly, sell high, repeat, and try not to fly into a
sector someone has mined with fighters.

It's a shared galaxy: everything the other players do stays done.  You
get a daily ration of turns.  Some of the other pilots out there don't
sleep.  I'm not saying they're computers.  I'm not saying they aren't.

Main Menu, D, then 2.  Today's news (bulletin 9) keeps the score.

-- Europa
